WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.790
Money is what we use to pay prices.

2
00:00:02.790 --> 00:00:05.500
But keeping money has a price too.

3
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:07.880
Cash in your pocket earns nothing.

4
00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:09.200
Swap it for a bond,

5
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:10.960
and you would earn interest.

6
00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:14.270
That interest is what
holding money costs you.

7
00:00:14.270 --> 00:00:16.440
So if money has a price,

8
00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:19.450
what makes that price go up or down?

9
00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:22.630
In this mission, you'll build
the diagram economists use

10
00:00:22.630 --> 00:00:25.110
for the market in money itself.

11
00:00:25.110 --> 00:00:27.560
Then you'll push the
price level up in a graph

12
00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:30.730
lab and predict where
the interest rate goes.

13
00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:34.270
Your mission: find out what
moves the price of money.
